WEBVTT

00:00:15.708 --> 00:00:17.125
Hiyu!

00:00:22.292 --> 00:00:24.000
Why you...

00:00:29.833 --> 00:00:32.083
<i>Time to die!</i>

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:37.000
<i>The perfect world!</i>

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:44.417
<i>Tsukiakari no shita de...</i>

00:00:44.417 --> 00:00:47.125
<i>Let's break the spine!</i>

00:00:47.125 --> 00:00:51.958
<i>...yakusoku wo kawashita</i>

00:00:51.958 --> 00:00:56.833
<i>Gozen reiji hoeru you ni sasayaite</i>

00:00:56.833 --> 00:01:02.250
<i>Chinmoku to zattou no naka</i>

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:07.458
<i>Kuruisou de kowaresou na genjou kai</i>

00:01:07.458 --> 00:01:11.417
<i>Kimi wa sou sa kimi no mama ikite</i>

00:01:11.417 --> 00:01:15.333
<i>That perfect world!</i>

00:01:15.333 --> 00:01:20.542
<i>Kamereon janakute</i>

00:01:20.542 --> 00:01:25.667
<i>Kokoro kara kawarou</i>

00:01:25.667 --> 00:01:29.375
<i>Kikoeru yo sono kotoba</i>

00:01:29.375 --> 00:01:35.875
<i>Subete no yoru ga akeru you ni sakebou</i>

00:01:35.875 --> 00:01:39.583
<i>Hageshisa to yasashisa de</i>

00:01:39.583 --> 00:01:51.167
<i>Subete no yoru ga sakeru you ni sakebou</i>

00:01:56.542 --> 00:01:59.750
Where did they go?

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:01.417
That's...

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:09.458
That guitar playing...

00:02:09.458 --> 00:02:11.833
Hey, you! Get back here!

00:02:15.167 --> 00:02:16.792
Hey!

00:02:16.792 --> 00:02:17.583
Kyouichi...

00:02:17.583 --> 00:02:19.000
Let's get after him, Tatsuma.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:19.833
Right.

00:02:19.833 --> 00:02:21.167
Hiyu...

00:02:21.167 --> 00:02:23.458
Get in touch with Kisaragi.

00:02:23.458 --> 00:02:26.208
They got their asses kicked pretty
bad by that lightning bastard.

00:02:26.208 --> 00:02:28.250
Do what you can to fix 'em up.

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:29.583
Right!

00:02:42.042 --> 00:02:43.583
Ryouichi...

00:02:46.292 --> 00:02:50.458
You are my enemy!

00:02:53.292 --> 00:02:54.458
"Dark Arts Chapter"

00:02:54.458 --> 00:02:55.542
"Dark Arts Chapter"
"Fourth Night"

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:57.542
"The Gathering"

00:02:58.083 --> 00:03:01.625
Ryouichi, it's me! Don't you recognize me?

00:03:01.625 --> 00:03:03.125
Stop right there!

00:03:03.125 --> 00:03:04.292
You two...

00:03:04.292 --> 00:03:07.458
Lightning bastard, who's he?

00:03:07.458 --> 00:03:10.167
This is none of your damn business.

00:03:10.167 --> 00:03:11.750
Get lost.

00:03:13.958 --> 00:03:16.708
It doesn't matter how
many of you swine there are.

00:03:16.708 --> 00:03:18.417
You're no match for me.

00:03:18.417 --> 00:03:21.083
What's that? What'd you say?!

00:03:21.083 --> 00:03:23.875
I said, you're swine.

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:41.750
Sound can interfere with
anything through its vibrations.

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:45.792
And at my command, it can do this too.

00:03:45.792 --> 00:03:47.125
Wait!

00:03:47.125 --> 00:03:52.000
Hey, Tatsuma, you friggin' swine!
Don't just stand there!

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:55.292
The hell you lookin' at?
Don't gawk at me like some kinda moron!

00:03:56.792 --> 00:03:59.500
Kyouichi's a dumb old idiot!
Kyouichi's a dumb old idiot!

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:02.625
Kyouichi's a piece of trash! Kyouichi's trash!

00:04:07.042 --> 00:04:08.250
Kyouichi!

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:13.042
What the hell was that?

00:04:13.042 --> 00:04:15.875
So, you've got power too then.

00:04:15.875 --> 00:04:17.833
It's magnificent, isn't it?

00:04:17.833 --> 00:04:22.042
All things obey me. I've acquired...

00:04:22.042 --> 00:04:26.208
...the power of a god.

00:04:26.208 --> 00:04:29.333
Ryouichi, you...

00:04:34.833 --> 00:04:37.375
The swine defy a god.

00:04:41.375 --> 00:04:44.958
Hey, Tatsuma, this isn't funny.

00:04:44.958 --> 00:04:47.708
You've got it wrong! I can't control my body!

00:04:49.583 --> 00:04:52.417
Stop it. Stop it, man.

00:05:00.083 --> 00:05:03.542
This isn't your sound!

00:05:04.917 --> 00:05:11.083
Your--no, our sound isn't like this!

00:05:17.292 --> 00:05:18.667
Raito...

00:05:21.958 --> 00:05:23.458
Ryouichi...

00:05:28.042 --> 00:05:29.292
Ryouichi!

00:05:30.292 --> 00:05:31.833
Stop!

00:05:31.833 --> 00:05:33.292
You two get lost!

00:05:33.292 --> 00:05:37.458
What was that? Whoa, hey, wait!

00:05:37.458 --> 00:05:40.458
Damn, that lightning bastard...

00:05:44.625 --> 00:05:47.708
Ohran Academy, Class 3-4, Hisui Kisaragi:

00:05:47.708 --> 00:05:49.833
President of the school's Tea Ceremony Club,

00:05:49.833 --> 00:05:51.750
proprietor of an antiques shop,
and well known hunk.

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:54.750
So, how do you two know each other?

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:59.042
Lady Aoi, I've told you time
after time not to act on your own!

00:05:59.042 --> 00:06:02.333
I'm sorry, but...

00:06:02.333 --> 00:06:04.500
What? Am I being ignored?

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:08.833
The flock of crows was being
controlled by the guy with the guitar.

00:06:08.833 --> 00:06:10.500
Isn't that right, Kyouichi?

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:14.708
Yeah, he friggin' controlled
our voices and bodies at will too.

00:06:14.708 --> 00:06:17.708
The ability to control atmospheric vibrations?

00:06:17.708 --> 00:06:19.667
Kyouichi said some very nasty things to me.

00:06:19.667 --> 00:06:21.833
I'm telling you that wasn't me!

00:06:21.833 --> 00:06:23.125
And choked me.

00:06:23.125 --> 00:06:25.042
Stop marring my reputation!

00:06:25.042 --> 00:06:28.833
Hell, you did the same to me!

00:06:28.833 --> 00:06:30.292
Listen, man...

00:06:30.292 --> 00:06:34.500
So, the guy with the mohawk,
he knows the guitar player?

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:37.333
I remember now! Crow! It was Crow!

00:06:37.333 --> 00:06:40.167
Jeez, you followed us all the way here!

00:06:40.167 --> 00:06:41.792
What are you, some kinda parasite?

00:06:41.792 --> 00:06:43.333
Not as much as you are.

00:06:43.333 --> 00:06:45.375
Wha... What was that?!

00:06:45.375 --> 00:06:47.292
Kyouichi!

00:06:49.125 --> 00:06:51.292
So, who's this "Crow"?

00:06:51.292 --> 00:06:53.875
They were this crazy-popular indie band.

00:06:53.875 --> 00:06:57.875
They only released eleven songs over two years,

00:06:57.875 --> 00:07:00.417
but every one of them was a hit supposedly.

00:07:00.417 --> 00:07:05.875
Oh, and all of the members are
Tokyo high schoolers, just like us.

00:07:05.875 --> 00:07:08.542
Seriously? So, who's the guy with the mohawk?

00:07:08.542 --> 00:07:10.708
That's Raito, the vocalist.

00:07:10.708 --> 00:07:13.875
Ryouichi was the key member of the band.

00:07:13.875 --> 00:07:15.958
He played guitar and wrote
and composed all their songs.

00:07:15.958 --> 00:07:20.042
He was known as a god within the scene, but...

00:07:20.042 --> 00:07:21.000
But?

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:24.583
Three months ago,
the band mysteriously broke up.

00:07:24.583 --> 00:07:28.375
I heard Ryouichi just disappeared.

00:07:28.375 --> 00:07:29.750
Why?

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:33.250
Dunno. It sounds like he was
a hard person to get along with,

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:37.750
so the rumor is they all got
into a lot of fights and stuff.

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:40.500
Three months ago...

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:43.417
About that time, huh?

00:07:43.417 --> 00:07:44.625
Yes...

00:07:45.792 --> 00:07:50.083
So, there are other people
besides us who have power.

00:07:50.083 --> 00:07:53.750
It means we'll have to fight other people too.

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:57.667
Why, what's wrong?

00:07:57.667 --> 00:07:59.875
What makes you cry?

00:07:59.875 --> 00:08:03.875
I can't do it after all. I just can't do it!

00:08:03.875 --> 00:08:07.917
Oh, you can. It's what he wants.

00:08:07.917 --> 00:08:09.042
But...

00:08:09.042 --> 00:08:12.625
You're the only one who can grant that wish.

00:08:12.625 --> 00:08:15.917
That's why he's chasing you.

00:08:15.917 --> 00:08:18.083
Have you forgotten?

00:08:18.083 --> 00:08:22.917
Raito wants this? I get it.

00:08:24.125 --> 00:08:26.208
Well, anyway...

00:08:26.208 --> 00:08:29.042
I'd sure like to settle things
with that lightning bastard,

00:08:29.042 --> 00:08:31.250
but for now we've gotta do something
about the crow master, right?

00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:33.333
For crying out loud!

00:08:33.333 --> 00:08:35.667
What the heck is going on here anyway?!

00:08:35.667 --> 00:08:39.375
Someone explain things so I can understand!

00:08:39.375 --> 00:08:40.875
Hey, Doom 'n Gloom.

00:08:40.875 --> 00:08:41.917
What?

00:08:41.917 --> 00:08:43.917
You got a wicker basket?

00:08:43.917 --> 00:08:45.250
Huh?

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:47.083
Well, I have a pot.

00:08:47.083 --> 00:08:48.333
Huh?

00:08:52.458 --> 00:08:56.458
I wonder if it was wrong
of us to do that to Tono?

00:08:56.458 --> 00:08:58.333
It's fine.

00:08:58.333 --> 00:09:03.167
With all we're up against,
we couldn't protect her if we wanted to.

00:09:06.708 --> 00:09:10.625
Don'tcha think, Misato?

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:13.708
Houraiji!

00:09:21.958 --> 00:09:25.458
Ryouichi, it's me, Raito!

00:09:25.458 --> 00:09:28.625
What the heck's gotten into you?!

00:09:39.792 --> 00:09:43.750
You were always alone
ever since you were a kid.

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:47.917
Well, both of us came
from broken homes after all.

00:09:47.917 --> 00:09:53.125
Listen, Ryouichi, I loved your guitar playing.

00:09:53.125 --> 00:09:55.958
That's why we started the band.

00:09:55.958 --> 00:09:58.625
You never tried to make any friends besides me,

00:09:58.625 --> 00:10:00.542
but I figured if we formed a band together,

00:10:00.542 --> 00:10:05.125
then you'd learn to get
along with other people too.

00:10:05.125 --> 00:10:07.792
You're changing it? Why?

00:10:07.792 --> 00:10:11.917
If we don't arrange it, the other
two won't be able to keep up.

00:10:11.917 --> 00:10:16.875
Raito, you said you'd never change this song.

00:10:16.875 --> 00:10:20.625
We're talking about a jam
session here. I got no choice.

00:10:20.625 --> 00:10:21.917
Ryouichi?

00:10:23.208 --> 00:10:25.500
You just vanished.

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:28.542
And that was the end of Crow too.

00:10:28.542 --> 00:10:32.708
I had put that band together for you.

00:10:34.375 --> 00:10:35.708
I've been looking for you!

00:10:35.708 --> 00:10:37.208
Let go! Let go!

00:10:37.208 --> 00:10:38.708
You're comin' home, Ryouichi!

00:10:38.708 --> 00:10:39.625
Forget it!

00:10:39.625 --> 00:10:43.208
Everyone's waiting for you.
You're coming with me!

00:10:49.542 --> 00:10:53.292
I've been able to use my
power ever since that day.

00:10:53.292 --> 00:10:57.083
When you disappeared again,
I went searching for you,

00:10:57.083 --> 00:11:00.417
thinking that maybe you
had acquired the ability too.

00:11:02.792 --> 00:11:06.250
And I was waiting for you too, Raito.

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:08.625
I've been waiting for you the whole time.

00:11:08.625 --> 00:11:12.708
I want them to hear the
sound we create together.

00:11:12.708 --> 00:11:16.917
I'll use these divine powers to
make those stinking swine hear it!

00:11:16.917 --> 00:11:20.583
That doesn't make you any god.

00:11:20.583 --> 00:11:23.750
What you are right now is a grim reaper!

00:11:29.083 --> 00:11:31.500
You cannot defy the sound of a god!

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:35.375
You know it, don't you? Eh, Raito?

00:11:35.375 --> 00:11:37.875
Ryouichi, you've already...

00:11:37.875 --> 00:11:41.458
Finally found you, lightning bastard!

00:11:41.458 --> 00:11:44.292
And the crow master!

00:11:44.292 --> 00:11:46.458
This is not any of your damn business!

00:11:46.458 --> 00:11:47.417
Stay the hell out of it!

00:11:47.417 --> 00:11:49.417
Can it, Mohawk!

00:11:49.417 --> 00:11:55.000
This ain't your problem or ours.
It's this whole city's problem!

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:58.875
Don't be so cocky that you
think you can fix things on your own!

00:11:58.875 --> 00:12:00.542
You...

00:12:00.542 --> 00:12:04.167
Fine then, I'll let you hear it...

00:12:04.167 --> 00:12:08.125
...the voice of god that we created.

00:12:14.583 --> 00:12:18.333
Darn it! This is a scoop!

00:12:26.917 --> 00:12:29.333
Kyouichi, behind you!

00:12:29.333 --> 00:12:30.333
Kyouichi!

00:12:30.333 --> 00:12:31.833
Ya muscle-bound gorilla!

00:12:31.833 --> 00:12:33.167
What was that?!

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:42.917
Why?

00:12:42.917 --> 00:12:48.000
I'm the one who attacked you! Why?

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:52.958
Hey, Aoi, is the guy with
the mohawk really not our enemy?

00:12:52.958 --> 00:12:55.167
Well...

00:12:55.167 --> 00:12:59.792
He's not an enemy. He wasn't
fighting us all out earlier either.

00:12:59.792 --> 00:13:01.208
Oh?

00:13:01.208 --> 00:13:06.000
All of his attacks missed our vital spots.

00:13:07.083 --> 00:13:10.375
It was so he could determine
if we were his enemies or not.

00:13:10.375 --> 00:13:15.375
Plus, you do not have murder in your eyes.

00:13:21.667 --> 00:13:25.583
Are we really going to fight another person?

00:13:25.583 --> 00:13:27.208
Looks like it.

00:13:34.042 --> 00:13:37.625
No good, Boss. There's just
not enough evidence to go by.

00:13:37.625 --> 00:13:39.958
Have you had a look at any
of the crow attack victims?

00:13:39.958 --> 00:13:42.417
No leads there.

00:13:42.417 --> 00:13:44.125
I see...

00:13:44.125 --> 00:13:47.083
Well, it's what we expected.

00:13:48.042 --> 00:13:53.000
You don't know when to quit.
I told you, I'll take care of Ryouichi.

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:56.417
Hey, you're the one who
needs to remember his own words.

00:13:56.417 --> 00:13:58.125
Weren't you lookin' for a jamboree?

00:13:58.125 --> 00:13:59.750
A jam session.

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:01.667
I know what I'm sayin'!

00:14:01.667 --> 00:14:04.500
Who the hell are you?

00:14:04.500 --> 00:14:08.292
We're going to protect everyone, protect this city.

00:14:08.292 --> 00:14:10.458
And to protect them, we fight.

00:14:15.042 --> 00:14:16.417
Let's do it!

00:14:31.542 --> 00:14:36.708
Ryouichi, can't we go back
to how things used to be?

00:14:36.708 --> 00:14:38.958
Can't you go back to being how you were?

00:14:47.667 --> 00:14:50.958
In that case, I'll...

00:15:14.042 --> 00:15:16.375
Did you mean to kill him?

00:15:21.333 --> 00:15:24.250
Did you also...

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:27.000
I couldn't do it. I couldn't!

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:30.000
There is no need to take anyone's life!

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:34.833
We have no idea what may have
happened between the two of you.

00:15:34.833 --> 00:15:40.583
But no matter how grave
the crimes he has committed,

00:15:40.583 --> 00:15:44.042
if we can save his soul, then I'm sure...

00:15:46.208 --> 00:15:48.917
Save his soul...

00:15:49.958 --> 00:15:51.792
What?

00:15:52.875 --> 00:15:57.542
You're the one who took them, Raito!

00:16:03.042 --> 00:16:04.917
You...

00:16:07.208 --> 00:16:08.708
Ryouichi?

00:16:11.708 --> 00:16:15.042
You did it to us.

00:16:15.042 --> 00:16:18.167
You ruined us!

00:16:36.917 --> 00:16:38.667
Ryouichi!

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:12.792
Three million yen...

00:17:13.917 --> 00:17:16.708
"Azumabashi Enterprises"

00:17:16.708 --> 00:17:20.708
Huh?! So you're in Kyouichi's gang?

00:17:20.708 --> 00:17:24.708
Yeah, the Boss is the one who opened my eyes.

00:17:24.708 --> 00:17:27.042
Well, you sure are a lifesaver!

00:17:27.042 --> 00:17:30.833
Anything for one of the Boss's school friends!

00:17:40.292 --> 00:17:41.708
Tatsuma!

00:17:44.875 --> 00:17:48.583
Sho Ji Tai San Kan On Myo Ji Rei!

00:18:08.833 --> 00:18:11.583
What the hell's goin' on?!

00:18:11.583 --> 00:18:14.042
Thanks! I'll be okay from here.

00:18:14.042 --> 00:18:18.292
Huh?! Seriously? But uh,
I think we oughta go back.

00:18:18.292 --> 00:18:20.625
Let me tell you about journalists.

00:18:20.625 --> 00:18:23.250
In this line of work, it's whoever
gets the scoop that wins!

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:25.750
Ryouichi!

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:27.625
Stinking monster!

00:18:30.958 --> 00:18:34.083
You say I ruined us?

00:18:34.083 --> 00:18:36.542
Well, what the hell are you now?

00:18:36.542 --> 00:18:40.375
What's this sound of a god all about?
Where's the sound we made?

00:18:40.375 --> 00:18:44.125
Did we make music for murdering people?

00:18:44.125 --> 00:18:49.208
What the hell did you write songs for?
Who'd you write 'em for?!

00:18:49.208 --> 00:18:51.458
Well, Ryouichi?!

00:19:01.333 --> 00:19:02.708
Ryouichi...

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:15.917
Tatsuma, what are you doing?

00:19:21.375 --> 00:19:26.042
Look, I feel bad for her, but it's too late.

00:19:26.042 --> 00:19:27.917
What we need to do now is stop him.

00:19:27.917 --> 00:19:32.375
I can't leave her here.
I can't leave her here!

00:19:33.750 --> 00:19:37.417
All right, leave the other guy to us then.

00:19:37.417 --> 00:19:38.625
Thanks.

00:19:55.333 --> 00:19:57.708
R-Raito!

00:19:57.708 --> 00:20:00.250
Ryouichi? You're...

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:01.750
What the hell is this?

00:20:05.375 --> 00:20:06.667
What's that?

00:20:18.375 --> 00:20:19.667
Ryouichi!

00:20:20.833 --> 00:20:22.208
Ryouichi!

00:20:28.208 --> 00:20:29.542
Raito...

00:20:30.917 --> 00:20:32.500
Ryouichi...

00:20:33.667 --> 00:20:35.875
What's going on?

00:20:35.875 --> 00:20:38.417
Dunno, man.

00:20:38.417 --> 00:20:41.583
He went back to normal?

00:20:45.792 --> 00:20:47.583
Ryouichi...

00:20:48.833 --> 00:20:54.500
That was wrong of you, Raito.
We made that song together.

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:57.250
It was ours and ours only.

00:20:57.250 --> 00:21:01.750
I thought you'd at least understand!

00:21:04.667 --> 00:21:08.667
You're still upset about that song?

00:21:08.667 --> 00:21:12.542
I wanted to protect it, no matter what.

00:21:13.792 --> 00:21:16.292
I want you to tell me.

00:21:16.292 --> 00:21:21.000
Why? How did you become a demon?

00:21:29.125 --> 00:21:31.417
The Dark Arts...

00:21:45.042 --> 00:21:46.875
Oh, phooey.

00:21:49.958 --> 00:21:52.667
We went and gave him power,

00:21:52.667 --> 00:21:56.167
but there's a trace of humanity left in him,

00:21:56.167 --> 00:21:58.958
